  <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.4vw, 22px); color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 50ch; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
    A monthly signal on what's coming next in culture - trends, drops, talent and the cultural shifts brands need to know about. No fluff, no spam.
  </p>
